# XJ380 控制中心页面配置（UTF-8，字段用 | 分隔）
# page|页面标识|侧栏标题
# h1/h2/h3|标题；text|正文；value|左侧文字|右侧值
# button|文字|值|按钮文字|action
# input|文字|值|按钮文字|action
# switch|文字|说明|状态值|action
# divider；space|像素；dynamic|default_apps 或 network_status
# 以 @ 开头的值由 ctrlmenu 的动态值注册表提供。
# 可显示文字支持 中文^English 双语格式。

page|system|系统^System
h1|系统^System
text|查看 XJ380、硬件和当前显示环境的基本信息。^View basic information about XJ380, hardware, and the current display environment.
h2|系统信息^System Information
value|产品^Product|XJ380 操作系统^XJ380 Operating System
value|发行版本^Release Version|@os_version
value|系统版本^System Version|@system_version
value|内核版本^Kernel Version|@kernel_version
h2|设备规格^Device Specifications
value|处理器^Processor|@cpu
value|运行内存^Memory|@memory
value|系统类型^System Type|x64 操作系统，基于 x86_64 处理器^x64 operating system, based on x86_64 processors
h3|显示^Display
value|当前分辨率^Current Resolution|@resolution
switch|以 MB 显示内存^Show memory in MB|关闭时以 GB 显示^Shows GB when disabled|@memory_mb|toggle_memory_unit

page|network|网络^Network
h1|网络^Network
text|查看 NetworkManager 当前导出的连接状态。^View the connection status currently exported by NetworkManager.
h2|运行状态^Runtime Status
value|状态文件^Status File|/run/NetworkManager/status
dynamic|network_status

page|appearance|外观^Appearance
h1|外观^Appearance
text|调整桌面和控制中心的显示方式。^Adjust how the desktop and Control Center are displayed.
h2|桌面背景^Desktop Background
h3|壁纸文件^Wallpaper File
input|文件路径^File Path|@background|更改^Change|edit_background
text|输入系统内可读取的图片绝对路径，确认后桌面会使用新壁纸。^Enter an absolute path to a readable image. The desktop will use it after confirmation.

page|apps|应用^Apps
h1|应用^Apps
text|为不同文件扩展名选择默认打开程序。^Choose default programs for file extensions.
h2|默认应用^Default Apps
dynamic|default_apps

page|time|时间与位置^Time & Region
h1|时间与位置^Time & Region
text|查看当前时间并调整本地时区偏移。^View the current time and adjust the local time zone offset.
h2|当前时间^Current Time
value|本地时间^Local Time|@current_time
h3|时区偏移^Time Zone Offset
button|向东调整一小时^Move one hour east|@timezone|+1 小时^+1 Hour|timezone_plus
button|向西调整一小时^Move one hour west|@timezone|-1 小时^-1 Hour|timezone_minus

page|device|设备^Devices
h1|设备^Devices
text|管理输入设备及其他硬件相关选项。^Manage input devices and other hardware-related options.
h2|鼠标^Mouse
h3|滚轮^Scroll Wheel
switch|控制中心滚轮反转^Reverse Control Center scrolling|反转本次控制中心会话的页面滚动方向^Reverse page scrolling for this Control Center session|@wheel_reverse|toggle_wheel_reverse
divider
h2|配置能力示例^Configuration Examples
text|页面支持一级、二级、三级标题、正文、键值、右侧按钮、右侧输入框、开关、分隔线和动态列表。^Pages support headings, text, key-value rows, right-side buttons, inputs, switches, dividers, and dynamic lists.

page|language|语言^Language
h1|语言^Language
text|切换系统显示语言。^Switch the system display language.
h2|显示语言^Display Language
value|当前语言^Current Language|@language
button|中文^Chinese|@language|设为中文^Use Chinese|language_zh
button|English^English|@language|Use English^Use English|language_en
